
### ========================================================
### KONFIGURASI BASE URL
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Ganti sesuai port backend kamu.
### Jika menggunakan port lain, ubah localhost:3000.


### ========================================================
### 1. AREA PARKIR
### Base Route: /api/area-parkir
### ========================================================


### 1.1 GET - Mengambil semua area parkir
GET {{baseUrl}}/area-parkir
Accept: application/json


### 1.2 GET - Mengambil area parkir berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/area-parkir/1
Accept: application/json


### 1.3 POST - Membuat area parkir baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/area-parkir
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_area": "Area Parkir A",
  "kapasitas": 20,
  "lokasi": "Lantai 1"
}


### 1.4 PUT - Mengubah data area parkir
PUT {{baseUrl}}/area-parkir/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_area": "Area Parkir A Updated",
  "kapasitas": 25,
  "lokasi": "Lantai 2"
}


### 1.5 DELETE - Menghapus area parkir
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/area-parkir/1
Accept: application/json



### ========================================================
### 2. KENDARAAN
### Base Route: /api/kendaraan
### ========================================================


### 2.1 GET - Mengambil semua kendaraan
GET {{baseUrl}}/kendaraan
Accept: application/json


### 2.2 GET - Mengambil kendaraan berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/kendaraan/1
Accept: application/json


### 2.3 POST - Mendaftarkan kendaraan baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/kendaraan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomor_plat": "B 1234 ABC",
  "jenis_kendaraan": "Mobil"
}


### 2.4 PUT - Mengubah data kendaraan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kendaraan/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomor_plat": "B 5678 XYZ",
  "jenis_kendaraan": "Mobil"
}


### 2.5 DELETE - Menghapus kendaraan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/kendaraan/1
Accept: application/json



### ========================================================
### 3. TRANSAKSI PARKIR
### Base Route: /api/transaksi-parkir
### ========================================================


### 3.1 GET - Mengambil semua transaksi parkir
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir
Accept: application/json


### 3.2 GET - Mengambil detail transaksi berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/1
Accept: application/json


### 3.3 GET - Mengambil riwayat transaksi kendaraan
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/kendaraan/1
Accept: application/json


### 3.4 GET - Mengambil semua kendaraan yang sedang parkir
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/aktif
Accept: application/json


### 3.5 GET - Mengecek transaksi aktif berdasarkan kendaraan
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/aktif/kendaraan/1
Accept: application/json


### 3.6 GET - Mengambil kendaraan yang parkir di area tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/area/2/aktif
Accept: application/json


### 3.7 GET - Menghitung jumlah kendaraan aktif dalam area
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/area/1/count
Accept: application/json


### 3.8 POST - Kendaraan masuk / membuat transaksi parkir
POST {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_kendaraan": 1,
  "id_area": 1,
  "biaya_parkir": 0
}


### 3.9 PUT - Kendaraan keluar / menyelesaikan transaksi
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/1/keluar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biaya_parkir": 5000
}


### 3.10 GET - Mengambil seluruh riwayat transaksi yang selesai
GET {{baseUrl}}/transaksi-parkir/riwayat
Accept: application/json



### ========================================================
### SELESAI - DOKUMENTASI API PARKIR
### ========================================================
